    {
      "id": "u_ad76666fffd0752ec226a1fe_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Downloading resources__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "ad76666fffd0752ec226a1fefed261dc05d324e26e7f02fe4c4cfff12beb6613",
      "context": "Downloaded resources > Downloading resources",
      "contextHash": "a1a05d3a9a04504e18714aafed0abb882c91d6be6bf4c35d8eb6d81549e785ff",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_399f3f38986b5ef44c55f286_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "When a feature needs resources that are not on the device yet, Trilium asks before downloading them. The dialog lists each resource with what it is used for, where it is downloaded from, its license and its size, followed by the total download size and the free space on the disk.",
      "sourceHash": "399f3f38986b5ef44c55f2864b79cc729c021359c7c45f8d32b509f899f4e706",
      "context": "Downloaded resources > Downloading resources",
      "contextHash": "a1a05d3a9a04504e18714aafed0abb882c91d6be6bf4c35d8eb6d81549e785ff",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e0f87ae1af5878a0d7f675c5_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To start the download, press __TRILIUM_PH_0__Download__TRILIUM_PH_1__. Each resource shows its progress, and the feature continues once all of them are downloaded.",
      "sourceHash": "e0f87ae1af5878a0d7f675c5ac5326dbba7154f96d2d7e1c7a4f50b5875a4735",
      "context": "Downloaded resources > Downloading resources",
      "contextHash": "a1a05d3a9a04504e18714aafed0abb882c91d6be6bf4c35d8eb6d81549e785ff",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c1646362b861d98c2c7be275_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To stop the download, press __TRILIUM_PH_0__Cancel__TRILIUM_PH_1__ or close the dialog. The files already downloaded are kept, and the next download continues where this one stopped, even within a large file.",
      "sourceHash": "c1646362b861d98c2c7be27536ac7165660633f78fd60777e6ee7a53adb6489c",
      "context": "Downloaded resources > Downloading resources",
      "contextHash": "a1a05d3a9a04504e18714aafed0abb882c91d6be6bf4c35d8eb6d81549e785ff",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_151a59a332accd4ff2751fc3_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "If the disk does not have enough free space, the dialog says so and the download cannot be started.",
      "sourceHash": "151a59a332accd4ff2751fc3f6b7a93022e45484bb7d8c79a5a701c343c735cd",
      "context": "Downloaded resources > Downloading resources",
      "contextHash": "a1a05d3a9a04504e18714aafed0abb882c91d6be6bf4c35d8eb6d81549e785ff",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5f2ef0358de3ea50f665deab_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Every file is checked against a checksum built into Trilium before it is used, so a file that was damaged or altered during the download is discarded.",
      "sourceHash": "5f2ef0358de3ea50f665deabd5d5139108a5b3b150f4091d01e6c11ac6e01a9a",
      "context": "Downloaded resources > Downloading resources",
      "contextHash": "a1a05d3a9a04504e18714aafed0abb882c91d6be6bf4c35d8eb6d81549e785ff",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ea769cb67f024d64c513d22a_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Downloaded resources are not synchronized. Each device that uses a feature downloads its resources separately, even when the notes are kept in sync through __TRILIUM_PH_0__Synchronization__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "ea769cb67f024d64c513d22a539effa1112750f1fbfce7cde8e772a2f2a660d2",
      "context": "Downloaded resources > Downloading resources",
      "contextHash": "a1a05d3a9a04504e18714aafed0abb882c91d6be6bf4c35d8eb6d81549e785ff",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c0d1dedc9b7be091efcb3ebb_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Managing downloaded resources__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "c0d1dedc9b7be091efcb3ebb4329c6acd8bbf8b89fd17f2cd22eba247bd3e8d7",
      "context": "Downloaded resources > Managing downloaded resources",
      "contextHash": "b3b73d7054e0064975260e5ce6d223d32ed4021cfd305ef78009876714d03f9d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_cc093748368c9cc9610bac08_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To see the downloaded resources, go to __TRILIUM_PH_0__Options__TRILIUM_PH_1__ → __TRILIUM_PH_2__Downloaded resources__TRILIUM_PH_3__. Each resource that was downloaded, or partly downloaded by an interrupted download, is listed with the space it takes on the disk and its status. Below the list, __TRILIUM_PH_4__Space used__TRILIUM_PH_5__ shows the space they take in total, and how much free space is left on the disk.",
      "sourceHash": "cc093748368c9cc9610bac08c80effe6bbdd83d146473979e39b4e306b1d9826",
      "context": "Downloaded resources > Managing downloaded resources",
      "contextHash": "b3b73d7054e0064975260e5ce6d223d32ed4021cfd305ef78009876714d03f9d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3817ce0230c35d222ed74689_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To open the folder of a resource, press the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ button (desktop only).",
      "sourceHash": "3817ce0230c35d222ed74689593a01aebeb42b3c660f2d676c5544dd623e5b9a",
      "context": "Downloaded resources > Managing downloaded resources",
      "contextHash": "b3b73d7054e0064975260e5ce6d223d32ed4021cfd305ef78009876714d03f9d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0120414b2e0e12df2db21077_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To delete a resource, press the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ button. If a feature needs it again, it is downloaded again.",
      "sourceHash": "0120414b2e0e12df2db210773cfc3b3dbbfd6c10e3ae6bef986d930339310fba",
      "context": "Downloaded resources > Managing downloaded resources",
      "contextHash": "b3b73d7054e0064975260e5ce6d223d32ed4021cfd305ef78009876714d03f9d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c19e32f90408386f7e572afa_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The list also shows, faded out, anything else in the resources folder:",
      "sourceHash": "c19e32f90408386f7e572afa3f82b6ee895e1ff1737b9fa7a9a0e557c9c9e7f5",
      "context": "Downloaded resources > Managing downloaded resources",
      "contextHash": "b3b73d7054e0064975260e5ce6d223d32ed4021cfd305ef78009876714d03f9d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b246f4578391ae8b4fe2dcb0_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Older version__TRILIUM_PH_1__: the files of an earlier version of a resource. When a resource is updated, the new version is downloaded into a new folder, and the old one is left behind.",
      "sourceHash": "b246f4578391ae8b4fe2dcb0fb8b21aec47e1c727c962f3f2edce5f43d04466a",
      "context": "Downloaded resources > Managing downloaded resources",
      "contextHash": "b3b73d7054e0064975260e5ce6d223d32ed4021cfd305ef78009876714d03f9d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2238c65d9eccf4dad255ed64_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Not used__TRILIUM_PH_1__: a resource that no feature of this installation uses, for example one downloaded by a feature that was removed.",
      "sourceHash": "2238c65d9eccf4dad255ed6424465faa5bb3ca356208ea2b1635c796cfe47698",
      "context": "Downloaded resources > Managing downloaded resources",
      "contextHash": "b3b73d7054e0064975260e5ce6d223d32ed4021cfd305ef78009876714d03f9d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f011323205c44b516b28b7c8_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Unknown__TRILIUM_PH_1__: any other file or folder, for example one copied there by hand.",
      "sourceHash": "f011323205c44b516b28b7c8ba7c41c2f82dbd083b53c6ad23e6f34f92dfb47d",
      "context": "Downloaded resources > Managing downloaded resources",
      "contextHash": "b3b73d7054e0064975260e5ce6d223d32ed4021cfd305ef78009876714d03f9d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b79af0b787f595069ef79cb7_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "These can be deleted in the same way.",
      "sourceHash": "b79af0b787f595069ef79cb7d9551165870dd3522c95996b972b25a9137ac329",
      "context": "Downloaded resources > Managing downloaded resources",
      "contextHash": "b3b73d7054e0064975260e5ce6d223d32ed4021cfd305ef78009876714d03f9d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7648d11116f4526b8d419df6_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "If a server and a desktop application share the same data directory, a resource used by only one of them shows as __TRILIUM_PH_0__Not used__TRILIUM_PH_1__ in the other. Deleting it there removes it for both.",
      "sourceHash": "7648d11116f4526b8d419df6e4e95528028c4c228cdec928056fa653711b252f",
      "context": "Downloaded resources > Managing downloaded resources",
      "contextHash": "b3b73d7054e0064975260e5ce6d223d32ed4021cfd305ef78009876714d03f9d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9ac58578d5b986114bcf2349_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Location__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "9ac58578d5b986114bcf2349341e819cafb37a5445f3f08688a87ddb8fe2b76d",
