    {
      "id": "u_e291753b07e262ba2b93302a_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To install a resource on a device that cannot download it, copy its folder from the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ folder of a device that already has it into the same place on the other device. The next time a feature asks to download it, press __TRILIUM_PH_1__Download__TRILIUM_PH_2__: the files already in place are checked against their checksums and kept, and only the missing ones are downloaded.",
